(7725966, 1271897, 100831, '<td valign="top">the beauty of mist... this needs a poem.</td>', 'the beauty of mist... this needs a poem.', '2022-08-07 17:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7725967, 1271887, 100831, '<td valign="top">moody and broody. Love it.</td>', 'moody and broody. Love it.', '2022-08-07 17:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7725969, 1271966, 15163, '<td valign="top">Mount Rainier?</td>', 'Mount Rainier?', '2022-08-07 18:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7725970, 1272014, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is too smooth. And yet it is quite nice. I like the smooth everywhere except on the butterfly''s wings. It just seems like that not having detail ruins the effect. Still a 7, though.</td>', 'This is too smooth. And yet it is quite nice. I like the smooth everywhere except on the butterfly''s wings. It just seems like that not having detail ruins the effect. Still a 7, though.', '2022-08-07 18:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7725971, 1271944, 103142, '<td valign="top">Others have probably told you, but the horizon not being straight really messes with the photo. What a wonder spot, but I think you could have done more with the processing to bring this beauty out. -6-</td>', 'Others have probably told you, but the horizon not being straight really messes with the photo. What a wonder spot, but I think you could have done more with the processing to bring this beauty out. -6-', '2022-08-07 18:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7725972, 1271757, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice! Great expression. She''s definitely thinking up something devious. :) -8-</td>', 'Nice! Great expression. She''s definitely thinking up something devious. :) -8-', '2022-08-07 18:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7725973, 1271887, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing! -8-</td>', 'Very intriguing! -8-', '2022-08-07 18:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7725974, 1271930, 103142, '<td valign="top">Except they''re not following it :P Very intriguing photo -8-</td>', 'Except they''re not following it :P Very intriguing photo -8-', '2022-08-07 18:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7725975, 1271904, 103142, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love egrets, and he''s a wonderful find. But it seems so over sharpened. :(</td>', 'I absolutely love egrets, and he''s a wonderful find. But it seems so over sharpened. :(', '2022-08-07 18:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7725976, 1271883, 103142, '<td valign="top">Lovely! Your choice of crop immediately threw me. Thinking "should have left more room on the left for him to look". But I actually got more and more interested. It makes me wonder, for some reason. -8-</td>', 'Lovely! Your choice of crop immediately threw me. Thinking "should have left more room on the left for him to look". But I actually got more and more interested. It makes me wonder, for some reason. -8-', '2022-08-07 18:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7725977, 1271875, 103142, '<td valign="top">Wow! Stunning! -9-</td>', 'Wow! Stunning! -9-', '2022-08-07 18:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7725978, 1272009, 103142, '<td valign="top">Another one that originally had my wanting more room on the left, but quickly liking the quirky crop. What I don''t like is the crop on the hand. I would have liked it cropped just a tad higher, or the hand held down just a bit lower. The wrist and hand coming out of the dark is startling -- which is interesting, but seeing the space in between the fingers doesn''t quite work. It draws the eyes there. I''d rather have it draw the eye to the bracelet on the wrist. Then it would make me wonder if it had special significance. -8- for making me think so much.</td>', 'Another one that originally had my wanting more room on the left, but quickly liking the quirky crop. What I don''t like is the crop on the hand. I would have liked it cropped just a tad higher, or the hand held down just a bit lower. The wrist and hand coming out of the dark is startling -- which is interesting, but seeing the space in between the fingers doesn''t quite work. It draws the eyes there. I''d rather have it draw the eye to the bracelet on the wrist. Then it would make me wonder if it had special significance. -8- for making me think so much.', '2022-08-07 18:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7725979, 1272016, 103142, '<td valign="top">Love it, but reall really wish the horizontal line was horizontal. It just feels like a tilted horizon. -7- as is. Could have been 8, maybe 9 with small tweaks.</td>', 'Love it, but reall really wish the horizontal line was horizontal. It just feels like a tilted horizon. -7- as is. Could have been 8, maybe 9 with small tweaks.', '2022-08-07 18:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7726033, 1271887, 637, '<td valign="top">Very satisfying.  Great placement of the house, wonderful capture of the waves.  So many textures.  Perhaps the horizon and the sky are too one-dimensional.  Can''t vote but would have voted 8.5</td>', 'Very satisfying.  Great placement of the house, wonderful capture of the waves.  So many textures.  Perhaps the horizon and the sky are too one-dimensional.  Can''t vote but would have voted 8.5', '2022-08-07 20:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7726034, 1271798, 637, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the subject is but I''m still captured by the interplay of lights and shadow.  Perhaps would have preferred less pavement in the front.  Can''t vote but would have voted 7</td>', 'Not sure what the subject is but I''m still captured by the interplay of lights and shadow.  Perhaps would have preferred less pavement in the front.  Can''t vote but would have voted 7', '2022-08-07 20:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7726035, 1271979, 637, '<td valign="top">Crazy interesting image.  Effective composition.  Nice subtle shades of color.  Can''t vote but would have voted 8</td>', 'Crazy interesting image.  Effective composition.  Nice subtle shades of color.  Can''t vote but would have voted 8', '2022-08-07 20:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7726036, 1271864, 637, '<td valign="top">Love the monochrome. and the textures... well composed... but I''m hungry for a more interesting subject.  Its kinda pedestrian.  Can''t vote but would have voted 7</td>', 'Love the monochrome. and the textures... well composed... but I''m hungry for a more interesting subject.  Its kinda pedestrian.  Can''t vote but would have voted 7', '2022-08-07 20:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7726037, 1271903, 637, '<td valign="top">Love the prominence or the blue in an otherwise blandly colored image.   Love t he textures.  Well composed.  Can''t vote but would have voted 8</td>', 'Love the prominence or the blue in an otherwise blandly colored image.   Love t he textures.  Well composed.  Can''t vote but would have voted 8', '2022-08-07 20:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7726038, 1271989, 637, '<td valign="top">Obviously you should be proud of the challenging capture. Well composed, good dof. Can''t vote but would have voted 8</td>', 'Obviously you should be proud of the challenging capture. Well composed, good dof. Can''t vote but would have voted 8', '2022-08-07 20:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7726039, 1271661, 637, '<td valign="top">Love the subtle textures and colors, especially in the sky.  The lights of the village and the road nicely balance the lightning.  Can''t vote but would have voted 9</td>', 'Love the subtle textures and colors, especially in the sky.  The lights of the village and the road nicely balance the lightning.  Can''t vote but would have voted 9', '2022-08-07 20:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7726040, 1271875, 637, '<td valign="top">Another vote to respond to climate change.  Love the textures, particular the mist on the hills and the clouds in the upper left corner of the image.  The approach of the sea sells this image for me.  Can''t vote but would have voted 8.5</td>', 'Another vote to respond to climate change.  Love the textures, particular the mist on the hills and the clouds in the upper left corner of the image.  The approach of the sea sells this image for me.  Can''t vote but would have voted 8.5', '2022-08-07 20:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7726041, 1271966, 637, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the blue and yellow on the skiers vs, the white/gray of the mountains and snow field.  Nice subtle green for the evergreens.  Seems to me the sky is overly blue.  Can''t vote but would have voted 7.5</td>', 'I like the contrast between the blue and yellow on the skiers vs, the white/gray of the mountains and snow field.  Nice subtle green for the evergreens.  Seems to me the sky is overly blue.  Can''t vote but would have voted 7.5', '2022-08-07 20:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7726044, 1271995, 637, '<td valign="top">I can feel the textures of the petals of the flower.  Nice full frame composition.  Effective subtle colors.  Can''t vote but would have voted 8</td>', 'I can feel the textures of the petals of the flower.  Nice full frame composition.  Effective subtle colors.  Can''t vote but would have voted 8', '2022-08-07 20:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7726045, 1271897, 637, '<td valign="top">Wish there were some more "life" to the sky and the water... Unfortunately they are featureless, which kind of compromises the drama of the pier jutting into the sea.<br/>Can''t vote but would have voted 7</td>', 'Wish there were some more "life" to the sky and the water... Unfortunately they are featureless, which kind of compromises the drama of the pier jutting into the sea.Can''t vote but would have voted 7', '2022-08-07 20:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7726046, 1272006, 637, '<td valign="top">Proud bird.  Well composed.  Subtle shades of color.  Can''t vote but would have voted 7.5</td>', 'Proud bird.  Well composed.  Subtle shades of color.  Can''t vote but would have voted 7.5', '2022-08-07 20:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7726047, 1272007, 637, '<td valign="top">Good morning clutter!  The sky is as cluttered as the marina and the village.  Nevertheless the colors are very effective.  Can''t comment on the composition cuz i don''t know where to look for the subject.  Not sure but maybe it would have worked better if the sky occupied 2/3 of the frame instead of 1/3.<br/> <br/>Can''t vote but would have voted 6.5</td>', 'Good morning clutter!  The sky is as cluttered as the marina and the village.  Nevertheless the colors are very effective.  Can''t comment on the composition cuz i don''t know where to look for the subject.  Not sure but maybe it would have worked better if the sky occupied 2/3 of the frame instead of 1/3. Can''t vote but would have voted 6.5', '2022-08-07 20:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7726070, 1271661, 103142, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning! The only thought Id have is if you could bring a little out in the lower left corner. Not much at all - just a tiny hint. The color or the sky is incredible, and I love the streak from the vehicle.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning! The only thought Id have is if you could bring a little out in the lower left corner. Not much at all - just a tiny hint. The color or the sky is incredible, and I love the streak from the vehicle.', '2022-08-07 22:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
