(7726089, 1271805, 637, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing these two are closer than the caption suggests!  Great composition and dof... maybe a little blown out in the lower left??? Can''t vote but would have voted 8 out of 10</td>', 'I''m guessing these two are closer than the caption suggests!  Great composition and dof... maybe a little blown out in the lower left??? Can''t vote but would have voted 8 out of 10', '2022-08-07 22:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
