(7726092, 1272018, 637, '<td valign="top">Without the caption I''d have no idea... An interesting image but not particularly remarkable to me.  Well composed but that probably wasn''t hard given the subject.  Can''t vote but would have voted 7.2</td>', 'Without the caption I''d have no idea... An interesting image but not particularly remarkable to me.  Well composed but that probably wasn''t hard given the subject.  Can''t vote but would have voted 7.2', '2022-08-07 22:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
